# poco

--- DeadMariachi_Cleanse | gadget | TID_ACCESSORY_POCO_CLEANSE_DESC
raw  Poco creates a large AoE lasting <!card.accessory.skill.projectile.spawnAreaEffectObject.timeMs.msAsSeconds> seconds that removes all adverse effects and grants them immunity while inside.
now  Poco creates a large AoE lasting 4 seconds that removes all adverse effects and grants them immunity while inside.
  card.accessory.skill.projectile.spawnAreaEffectObject.timeMs.msAsSeconds  4  -> 4

--- DeadMariachi_Cleanse | gadget | TID_DEAD_MARIACHI_BUDDY_GADGET_2_DESC
raw  Poco creates a very large area lasting <!buddy.accessory.skill.projectile.spawnareaeffectobject.timems.msasseconds> sec that removes all negative effects from teammates and gives them immunity while inside.
now  Poco creates a very large area lasting 6 sec that removes all negative effects from teammates and gives them immunity while inside.
  buddy.accessory.skill.projectile.spawnareaeffectobject.timems.msasseconds  6  -> 6

--- DeadMariachi_Regen | gadget | TID_ACCESSORY_POCO_REGEN_DESC
