  card.accessory.areaeffect.damage.scaleStatToLevel.negate  -  -> 1400
  card.accessory.repeatAreaEffectiveCount  -  -> 3

--- DeadMariachi_Regen | gadget | TID_DEAD_MARIACHI_BUDDY_GADGET_1_DESC
raw  Poco and all nearby teammates heal for <!card.accessory.areaeffect.damage.scaleStatToLevel.negate> health <!card.accessory.repeatAreaEffectiveCount> times.\nTeammates inside the healing circle also gain <!buddy.accessory.areaeffect.statuseffectally.decreasereloadtimepercent>% reload speed.
now  Poco and all nearby teammates heal for <!card.accessory.areaeffect.damage.scaleStatToLevel.negate> health <!card.accessory.repeatAreaEffectiveCount> times.\nTeammates inside the healing circle also gain 25% reload speed.
  card.accessory.areaeffect.damage.scaleStatToLevel.negate  -  -> 1400
  card.accessory.repeatAreaEffectiveCount  -  -> 3
  buddy.accessory.areaeffect.statuseffectally.decreasereloadtimepercent  25  -> 25

