--- DeadMariachi_overcharge | hypercharge | TID_DEAD_MARIACHI_OVERCHARGE_DESC
raw  Encore now overheals, adding a decaying shield for the amount overhealed. Shield lasts for <!card.value.ticksAsSeconds> seconds.
now  Encore now overheals, adding a decaying shield for the amount overhealed. Shield lasts for 5 seconds.
  card.value.ticksAsSeconds  5  -> 5

--- DeadMariachi_overcharge | hypercharge | TID_DEAD_MARIACHI_BUDDY_OVERCHARGE_DESC
raw  Encore now overheals, adding a decaying shield for the amount over healed. Shield lasts for <!card.value.ticksAsSeconds> seconds. Main attacks fire in a <!card.character.weaponSkill.overchargedVersion.spread> degree cone.
now  Encore now overheals, adding a decaying shield for the amount over healed. Shield lasts for 5 seconds. Main attacks fire in a 180 degree cone.
  card.value.ticksAsSeconds  5  -> 5
  card.character.weaponSkill.overchargedVersion.spread  180  -> 180

